flowchart LR
  Operator[Client operator] --> Installer[Install CLI]
  Installer -->|Generate keypair| Identity[Installation identity]
  Installer -->|Activation key + public key| LicenseServer[AXIMA licensing server]
  LicenseServer -->|Publisher-signed grant| Installer
  Installer --> Secrets[Restricted local secrets]
  Installer --> App[Self-hosted AXIMA app]
  App -->|Local signature + identity check| Grant[Local license grant]
  App --> DB[(Client PostgreSQL)]
  App -.->|Optional status/update check| LicenseServer
  Copy[App + config without private key] --> Rejected[Activation required]

